## Решение

The ledger is prerequisite observation, not a consent queue. P1/P3.1/P6.1 docs preparation may close with explicit pending entries; their deliverables do not require approvals. Each runtime item checks exact applicable nonempty gates before dispatch. Accepted ledger status does not grant listed rights.

