## Почему

These inputs are independent of selected design direction; request preparation is reversible work. Missing authority must not leak into batches or be described as product GREEN. No new-table claim exempts index from schema approval. Central actingIdentityId body+service token without account-bound policy proof is not sufficient authorization evidence.

## Consequences

P1.2/P3.1 produce concrete review packets without waiting for owner response. Later accepted qualification/approval D# binds exact changed spec/Files/reads; never rewrite this ledger to claim approval. Symbol/test source pins recheck affected delta. Implementation does not guess transport/event/cache/session semantics. Release/pristine pending keeps external FLEX-2 acceptance pending, not every docs task blocked. No central business code, public-major or DDL executed by design.
